Action text:
- Introduced in rails 6
- integrates the Trix editor into Rails
- enables users to format text, embed images and videos, and create links






Action Text is another powerful addition to Rails 6, offering rich-text editing capabilities.
It integrates the Trix editor into Rails and provides a seamless way to handle rich content in applications.
Action Text enables users to format text, embed images and videos, and create links, all in a user-friendly interface.
With this feature, developers can effortlessly incorporate rich-text functionality into their applications, enhancing the user experience.